OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AThe next James Bond: The (00)7
OL,4,Aquestions fans want answered
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe last announcement of a new Bond was
OL,7,F21 years ago in 2005. So it's
OL,8,Finevitable for Bond fans to want to
OL,9,Fhave their questions answered about the
OL,10,Ffuture of one of cinema's most sought
OL,11,Fafter roles, in one of cinema's biggest
OL,12,Ffranchises.
OL,14,FThis is, of course, the big question
OL,15,Ffans have been talking about for the
OL,16,Flast six years. And with an
OL,17,Fannouncement edging closer and closer,
OL,18,Fthe speculation has intensified
OL,19,Frecently.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
